{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function useQueryErrorResetBoundary(): QueryErrorResetBoundaryValue;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/preact-query/src/QueryErrorResetBoundary.tsx#L92","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/preact-query/src/QueryErrorResetBoundary.tsx:92"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This hook will reset any query errors within the closest "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryErrorResetBoundary"},{"type":"text","value":". If there is no boundary\ndefined it will reset them globally."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryErrorResetBoundaryValue"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The boundary's QueryErrorResetBoundaryValue."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useErrorBoundary } from 'preact/hooks'\nimport type { ComponentChildren } from 'preact'\nimport { useQueryErrorResetBoundary } from '@tanstack/preact-query'\n\nfunction App({ children }: { children: ComponentChildren }) {\n  const { reset } = useQueryErrorResetBoundary()\n  const [error, resetError] = useErrorBoundary(() => reset())\n\n  if (error) {\n    return (\n      <div>\n        There was an error!\n        <button onClick={() => resetError()}>Try again</button>\n      </div>\n    )\n  }\n\n  return children\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction useQueryErrorResetBoundary(): QueryErrorResetBoundaryValue;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-query/src/QueryErrorResetBoundary.tsx:92](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/preact-query/src/QueryErrorResetBoundary.tsx#L92)\n\nThis hook will reset any query errors within the closest `QueryErrorResetBoundary`. If there is no boundary\ndefined it will reset them globally.\n\n## Returns\n\n`QueryErrorResetBoundaryValue`\n\nThe boundary's QueryErrorResetBoundaryValue.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nimport { useErrorBoundary } from 'preact/hooks'\nimport type { ComponentChildren } from 'preact'\nimport { useQueryErrorResetBoundary } from '@tanstack/preact-query'\n\nfunction App({ children }: { children: ComponentChildren }) {\n  const { reset } = useQueryErrorResetBoundary()\n  const [error, resetError] = useErrorBoundary(() => reset())\n\n  if (error) {\n    return (\n      <div>\n        There was an error!\n        <button onClick={() => resetError()}>Try again</button>\n      </div>\n    )\n  }\n\n  return children\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useQueryErrorResetBoundary\ntitle: useQueryErrorResetBoundary\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction useQueryErrorResetBoundary(): QueryErrorResetBoundaryValue;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-query/src/QueryErrorResetBoundary.tsx:92](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/preact-query/src/QueryErrorResetBoundary.tsx#L92)\n\nThis hook will reset any query errors within the closest `QueryErrorResetBoundary`. If there is no boundary\ndefined it will reset them globally.\n\n## Returns\n\n`QueryErrorResetBoundaryValue`\n\nThe boundary's QueryErrorResetBoundaryValue.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nimport { useErrorBoundary } from 'preact/hooks'\nimport type { ComponentChildren } from 'preact'\nimport { useQueryErrorResetBoundary } from '@tanstack/preact-query'\n\nfunction App({ children }: { children: ComponentChildren }) {\n  const { reset } = useQueryErrorResetBoundary()\n  const [error, resetError] = useErrorBoundary(() => reset())\n\n  if (error) {\n    return (\n      <div>\n        There was an error!\n        <button onClick={() => resetError()}>Try again</button>\n      </div>\n    )\n  }\n\n  return children\n}\n```\n"}
